354893_2123985974762689_1544591742969265917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1T-w2CcTojIQ7kNvwHsCOuG&_nc_oc=AdpwmgxbRgrWchLZGIOK3h3sZl6a0VkBw7oPGtQFa5xJYvWfwH4ypnfW_F3B5ixOwEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUfvzTpN4OTSxza9TJaqAMuu1K64DPiwBfMS5oAc4Y_wA&oe=6B105363"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1479678613042418", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300750_1479678616375751_6997581480530838541_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=siSlzBKzPagQ7kNvwEkiRe_&_nc_oc=AdrFVEK4-KrG8EGGdiy6yJVTJgQNQreeAPyRby7ROWbq9v4opSrI3Cw-1-bjkIEbvrM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXgMuJTy3KowAKsfCvX4ZcEHNeQ_YdU8GLSIleyIX54vw&oe=6B105270"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "1245528793651676", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349371_1245528796985009_3447873084062975841_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W6xlEIoOgdkQ7kNvwHhEou2&_nc_oc=AdoOivpGR68zHI2v7T7zqDm46YOCI1PA60Ohn59_NGGHZze_Un4tYbH2s91CFgEARBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXjkMvRHk_NTw2HVZBzTi2jViDS04gRnr9RIy0y1avCPg&oe=6B10512D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hero360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely during a fire\u2014whether or not a smoke alarm is present. The name \u201cHERO\u201d reflects the purpose of the app: to empower users to become their own hero by learning life-saving reflexes and making the right decisions in a high-risk situation. Surviving a fire starts with knowledge and preparation\u2014HERO 360 gives users the chance to practice that before it\u2019s real.", "short_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely dur